  "protocol_decisions": [
    "All endpoints use the one immutable tokenizer fitted only on domain training records.",
    "Each endpoint is the exact declared committed-target budget; it is not an earlier minimum-loss checkpoint.",
    "Adaptation is weight promotion from its same-seed synthetic endpoint with fresh optimizer and counters, never resume.",
    "Cards use literal_full_answer_exact_v1 with trim_outer_whitespace/full_answer; no case folding, Unicode normalization, or internal-whitespace normalization.",
    "Evaluate acquisition, development, and frozen cards before and after adaptation for every seed; no score selects checkpoints, seeds, or reruns.",
    "Retention is CE/perplexity over the exact same frozen synthetic validation tokens at both endpoints; report it separately from assistant-only domain development loss.",
    "The finite authored oracle-answer pool has no open-vocabulary chance baseline; controls are explicit non-claims.",
    "Exclude path values with meaningful outer whitespace because reply extraction trims outer whitespace."
  ],
  "result_policy": "No training, capability, card, loss, perplexity, checkpoint-selection, or hardware result belongs in this ledger.",
